and AAA hopefully can be outrun.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Willy Wonka's Saucer Factory\n Direction         : West\n Distance          : 10 miles  \n Difficulty        : 5\n\nSxyth -305686 1343880 109100 12082\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  To the west is a large saucer making facility.  Take out these sites\nand clean up the runaway saucers.   \n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Romper Room\n Direction         : East North East\n Distance          : 8 miles  \n Difficulty        : 2\n\nSxyth -585670 -1425877 123595 56584\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  Floods of reports of mental disturbances lead our intelligence team\nto look for a mindbender in the area.  Sure enough, a new alien base has\npopped up to the East of here.\n  Drop a bomb on that mindbender to free our forces from that hideous\nmental attack.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Guinea Pig\n Direction         : South East\n Distance          : 14 miles  \n Difficulty        : 6\n\nSxyth -2381728 -1967742 70116 47616\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  We haven't been able to ascertain the effect of portals on the\nexperimental fighter yet.   We need you to fly through two of the four\nportals at the alien base to the southeast of here.\n  Also, take out all that tofu at the site as a secondary objective.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Mission Code Name : Sommerset\n Direction         : South\n Distance          : 14 miles  \n Difficulty        : 6\n\nSxyth -2127424 241832 302741 39240\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  By now you should be able to land this feisty aircraft pretty well.\nAlthough your plane isn't ideal for this mission, it's all we've got.\nGo South to the suspended airstrip at 15,000 feet.  Land and get the \nsecret info from the spy there, and bring it back to us.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------","starts":[{"position_cm":[4087739,-512828,54918],"yaw":9758,"name":"Curveball","named":true,"direction":"North","distance":"30 miles","difficulty":"4","briefing":"Far to the north of here there is a stronghold with a generator orb.\nWe have been unable to touch this site before due to the intense KLA and\nAAA activity.\n  We now put all our hopes in the new experimental aircraft.  With its\ngreat speed the KLA's and AAA hopefully can be outrun."},{"position_cm":[-305686,1343880,109100],"yaw":12082,"name":"Willy Wonka's Saucer Factory","named":true,"direction":"West","distance":"10 miles","difficulty":"5","briefing":"To the west is a large saucer making facility.  Take out these sites\nand clean up the runaway saucers."},{"position_cm":[-585670,-1425877,123595],"yaw":56584,"name":"Romper Room","named":true,"direction":"East North East","distance":"8 miles","difficulty":"2","briefing":"Floods of reports of mental disturbances lead our intelligence team\nto look for a mindbender in the area.  Sure enough, a new alien base has\npopped up to the East of here.\n  Drop a bomb on that mindbender to free our forces from that hideous\nmental attack."},{"position_cm":[-2381728,-1967742,70116],"yaw":47616,"name":"Guinea Pig","named":true,"direction":"South East","distance":"14 miles","difficulty":"6","briefing":"We haven't been able to ascertain the effect of portals on the\nexperimental fighter yet.   We need you to fly through two of the four\nportals at the alien base to the southeast of here.\n  Also, take out all that tofu at the site as a secondary objective."},{"position_cm":[-2127424,241832,302741],"yaw":39240,"name":"Sommerset","named":true,"direction":"South","distan